  "source_save_requirements": [
    "A genuine production campaign with funded distinct economic counterparties, actual orders and an oracle-qualified mature coin; retain its physical-save hash and originating business evidence.",
    "Use an additional genuine pre-risk position in the same campaign for a possible gap/default. Its pending price change must come from real trades or observed model-index inputs. No fixture may set prices, balances, leverage, margin, orders or debt.",
    "Record at least seven qualifying completed coin days; a 10x test additionally needs the actual 14-day and 30-day listing qualifications. Model indexes support at most 5x; present single-venue coins never authorize 20x.",
    "A dated contract that actually expires within the allocated 14 days and a perpetual contract with real execution premium are needed for expiry and funding observations. If unavailable, those subcases remain NOT_OBSERVED.",
    "A genuine model-index pair may instead use targets.indexId 1/2/3 with coinId null; both sides and their money must still exist. This route does not grant mature-coin 10x or market-price manipulation credit."
  ],
